OL,3,GNEWSAWhale's body recovered after four
OL,4,Adays on beach
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe body of a whale has been recovered
OL,7,Fmore than four days after washing up on
OL,8,Fa beach.
OL,10,FThe 4.8m (15.7 ft) cetacean is the
OL,11,Flargest of six to have died when 40
OL,12,Fpilot whales were seen "distressed" off
OL,13,Fthe Northumberland coast in September,
OL,14,FBritish Divers Marine Life Rescue
OL,15,F(BDMLR) said.
OL,17,FIts body was near Hadston Rocks in
OL,18,FAmble and was first reported to the
OL,19,Fcoastguard and Northumberland County
OL,20,FCouncil on Monday, the day after it had
OL,21,Fbeached.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
